cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite it as below, with the version you used.
  Please also cite the original methodological sources listed with each recommendation.
type: software
title: "Biostat Compass"
abstract: >-
  A web application that guides students and researchers in biostatistics to choose a
  statistical model from the research question, study design and data structure. Every
  recommendation is based on published methodological literature, which the tool cites.
  The project was built entirely with Claude Code (Anthropic), directed and reviewed by the author.
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-06
authors:
